WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,300
The fourth brother wants to say that Fanfan really smells good.

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,800
Thank you, brother. I like brother the most.

3
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:07,300
I wouldn't be able to say this even to death.

4
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:09,700
The eldest brother wants to say, brother, you're welcome

5
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,800
Big brother also likes you the most

6
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,200
I can't say this even if I kill three younger brothers.

7
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:21,540
Good night, big brother. Fourth brother, I love you.

8
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:28,690
Good night. There is an important project abroad that I need to fly to urgently.

9
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:33,100
Will you leave it to you to take care of me, Yoyo?

10
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:35,440
Yes, I have an opinion

11
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:45,180
She benefits from money. Let me ask you a question.

12
00:00:45,180 --> 00:00:46,580
The weather is good today

13
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:48,980
I plan to take Jiaojiao to visit Miaofa Temple.

14
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:51,280
Pray for her to be safe, grandpa and grandma

15
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:52,680
You guys have already had a hard time raising Jiaojiao.

16
00:00:52,680 --> 00:00:53,780
Let Yoyo stay at home

17
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:54,880
What's this

18
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:58,180
It's rare to go out to play. I'll take Yoyo with you.

19
00:00:58,180 --> 00:01:11,720
Little cutie, do you still remember my brother?

20
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:16,880
Celebrate, you are not filming

21
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:22,890
I stopped working and just went out to relax.

22
00:01:22,890 --> 00:01:30,200
Jiaojiao, long time no see. Do you miss your third brother?

23
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:33,640
Are you afraid that I will miss you? Or are you afraid that I will not miss you?

24
00:01:33,640 --> 00:01:35,640
Not serious all day

25
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:39,560
Since you are going to the countryside, you should change into some decent clothes.

26
00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:47,780
As ordered, the Queen Mother

27
00:01:47,780 --> 00:01:49,780
You know a lot at a young age
